  "officialHtml": "https://github.com/GraniteState/adm-rules-data/blob/1c92d82e0f03a582ca5b7a578588edf38de2318e/raw/2026-11-15/state_agencies/he-m300.html",
  "prefLabel": "He-M 315.06 Fundamental Rights",
  "priorExpiration": "2013-10-06",
  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "He-M 315.06 Fundamental Rights.\n\n(a) No PSA shall deprive a member or participant of any legal right to which all citizens of New Hampshire and the United States are entitled.\n\n(b) The legal rights protected shall include:\n\n(1) The right of freedom of religion and religious preference, including the right to be free from engaging in any religious activity or practice; and\n\n(2) The right not to be discriminated against in any manner as defined 315.03 (c)\n\nSource. #8445, eff 10-6-05, EXPIRED: 10-6-13\n\nNew. #12191, eff 5-26-17",
  "source": "https://github.com/GraniteState/adm-rules-data/blob/1c92d82e0f03a582ca5b7a578588edf38de2318e/raw/2026-11-15/state_agencies/he-m300.html"
